<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Femsa started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Femsa started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg analyst Tim Baker started coverage of Fomento Economico Mexicano SA de CV, or Femsa, Tuesday with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Femsa is poised for continued solid growth in cash flows, driven by improvements in the company's key consumer markets, a better pricing environment and soft raw materials' prices,&quot; Baker wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe this to be substantially supported by excellent second-quarter results, especially from Femsa Cerveza&quot; and bottler Coca-Cola FEMSA SA.</p>
<p>-- Femsa's B shares were up 0.10 peso to 50.10 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
